## Cursor‑specific Guidance
- Start with a quick discovery pass; prefer semantic code search when exploring
- Propose minimal, surgical edits; preserve existing formatting and structure
- When adding controller/service/repository files, also add imports, providers, and `part` directives
- After edits that touch codegen or adapters, run build_runner
- Keep code snippets in discussions small and focused; cite file paths when referring to code
- Write high-clarity, well-named code; avoid clever one-liners 